        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye iwe Beleshazzari, mutabane we, weena tiweewombeeseeku naire, waire ng'ebyo byonabyona wabimanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weekuluntaliiza ku Musengwa ow'eigulu. Waalagira baaleeta ebikopo ebyatoolebwa mu isinzizo lye, olwo iwe mwene n'abakungu bo, ni bakazi bo ab'omu ndhu n'ab'embali, mwabinhweramu omwenge ogw'emizabbibu. Era mwasaaka ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda, ebitabona, waire okuwulira, oba okutegeera, bye baakola obw'omu zaabu, ni mu feeza, ni mu kyuma eky'ekikomo, ni mu kyuma ekigumu einho, ni mu miti, ni mu mabaale. Aye mwaloba kuta kitiisa mu Katonda oyo agemereire obulamu bwaimwe era abalabirira mu buli nsambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale kyaviire n'atuma omukono ogwo okwidha okukola ekighandiiko ekyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bino n'ebighandiikiibwa: ‘OKUBALA, OKUBALA, OKUPIMA, OKUGABANIA.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakulu gaabyo ni gano: ‘OKUBALA,’ Katonda amaze okubala enaku edh'obwakyabazinga bwo, yaabona nga dhiwoireku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘OKUPIMA,’ Katonda akupimye ku minzaani, yaabona ng'oli muwewere inho, okaabulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘OKUGABANIA,’ obwakyabazinga bwo abugabainiamu ghabiri, yaabugha Abamedi n'Abaperusi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
